Apple this week introduced the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/apple-homepod-mini-2/">HomePod mini 2</a>, and we have rounded up all of the new features and changes that we have uncovered so far below.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/homepod-mini-2-feature2.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1070600" /><br/>
HomePod mini 2 can be pre-ordered now and launches Friday, October 30, but Siri AI support will not be available <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/homepod-mini-2-siri-ai-coming-later/">until a future software update</a>.<br/>
<br/>
Here is what is new with the HomePod mini 2:<ul><br/>
<li>Siri AI support is coming in a future software update, with an Apple Intelligence-enabled iPhone or iPad required for requests involving your personal context.</li><br/>
<li>S10 chip, up from the S5 chip for the previous model. It is unclear if this chip upgrade enables computational audio improvements.</li><br/>
<li>Wi-Fi 6E support, up from Wi-Fi 4 for the previous model.</li><br/>
<li>Bluetooth 6 support, up from Bluetooth 5 for the previous model.</li><br/>
<li>Default audio output support <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/homepod-mini-2-default-mac-speaker/">on Macs with Wi-Fi 6E and later</a>.</li><br/>
<li><a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/apple-homepod-mini-2/">Sound Glow</a>: the top area glows and pulses in sync with the music playing.</li><br/>
<li><a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/new-apple-tv-4k-four-homepods-surround-sound/">Four-speaker surround sound</a> with the new Apple TV 4K: connect four HomePod mini 2 speakers in front and rear pairs.</li><br/>
<li>Three microphones for Siri, down from four in the previous model.</li><br/>
<li>Two all-new color options: green and pink.</li><br/>
<li>While it is the most minor of differences, the HomePod mini 2's listed weight is 3% lower than the previous model.</li><br/>
<li>A price increase. In the U.S., the HomePod mini 2 is priced at &#36;149. The previous model was initially &#36;99 and later &#36;129.</li><br/>
